    "description": "• Develop full-stack Java/Spring Boot and Angular applications supporting participant platforms managing $100B+ in assets.\n• Built a Python-based Splunk log analysis workflow that reduced production triage time by ~40%.\n• Developed an integration POC aggregating multiple DEC endpoints and reduced redundant API calls through improved state management.\n• Built internal AI/automation tooling to improve engineering productivity and accelerate codebase understanding.\n• Modernized legacy Backbone functionality and contributed to Angular migration efforts.",
